Sentence|Translation
Glindesdi, jau vegn ad ir a Pajais Bass|On Monday, I will go to the Netherlands
Glindesdi u mardi|Monday or Tuesday?
Il glindesdi, jau mangel charn|On Mondays, I eat meat
Il mardi, il pesch va a Tirchia|On Tuesdays, the fish goes to Turkey
La mesemna, els han duas uras, però la gievgia, els han trais minutas|On wednesdays, they have two hours, but on thursdays, they have three minutes
Mesemna, nus vegnin ad ir a Frantscha|On Wednesday, we're going to go to France
Gievgia, ella vegn ad esser bain|On Thursday, she will be well
Vegns ti a star qua venderdi?|Will you be here on Friday?
Sonda e dumengia|Saturday and sunday
Il venderdi, jau fatsch pasta|On fridays, I make pasta
La sonda, jau vom ad ina bacharia e ina furnaria|On saturdays, I go to a butchery and a bakery
La dumengia, els van davos la buita|On sundays, they go behind the shop